window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b216-505770414cc632a7.json"]={sha256:"505770414cc632a7535b243be052b529fed169bcc9160c85835fc1abcd55ac8c",value:{"id":"b216","title":"翡翠水庫大壩","titleEn":"Feitsui Dam","category":"water","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"翡翠案例結合拱壩的水平傳力與垂直懸臂、基岩層面有效應力、溫度接縫和水庫分層取水。課程將防洪蓄量、溢流消能及原水混合分開建模，避免把水位、濁度和結構安全視為同一指標。每個推導均要求確認幾何、量測基準與不能外推的條件。","summaryEn":"The Feitsui case combines horizontal arch transfer and vertical cantilever response with bedding-plane effective stress, thermal joints and stratified withdrawal. Flood storage, spillway dissipation and raw-water mixing are modeled separately so that level, turbidity and structural response are not confused. Each derivation requires explicit geometry, measurement references and limits on extrapolation.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"water-dams","subcategoryTitle":"世界水壩與水庫","subcategoryTitleEn":"World dams and reservoirs","learningTrack":"water","learningSubdiscipline":"water-dams","learningTags":["water","water-dams","water"],"architectureFamily":"water-dam","architectureNodes":[["名目停留時間與水齡","Nominal residence and water age"],["拱與懸臂剛度分力","Arch and cantilever load sharing"],["溫度變形與接縫開度","Thermal movement and joint gap"],["颱風入流與短時水位","Storm inflow and short term level"],["原水保守溶質混合","Conservative raw water mixing"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,1]],"diagram":{"type":"water-dam","labels":["名目停留時間與水齡","拱與懸臂剛度分力","溫度變形與接縫開度","颱風入流與短時水位","原水保守溶質混合"],"labelsEn":["Nominal residence and water age","Arch and cantilever load sharing","Thermal movement and joint gap","Storm inflow and short term level","Conservative raw water mixing"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"假想有效水量二千萬立方公尺、平均取水每秒四立方公尺，以體積除流量得名目停留時間五百萬秒，約五十七點八七日；實際水齡仍受密度流與短路影響。另設水平拱剛度三千、垂直懸臂剛度二千兆牛頓每公尺，在總力五十兆牛頓下，拱分擔三十兆牛頓。若拱剛度下降百分之二十，拱分力成二十七點二七三兆牛頓。這是共同位移的雙彈簧模型，不應拿分力直接宣布壩體安全。 核驗：V=20000000 m3; Q=4 m3/s; tau=V/Q/86400=57.87037 day。核對體積是有效交換區還是總庫容，將流量平均時段寫清楚。用水溫或保守示蹤物的深度剖面辨識隔離水層，再比較不同取水高程的到達時間，檢查名目周轉是否掩蓋短路。","textEn":"Assume 20 million m3 of active water and mean withdrawal of 4 m3/s. Volume divided by flow gives a nominal residence time of five million seconds, or 57.87 days; actual water age still depends on density currents and short circuiting. Separately, arch and cantilever stiffnesses of 3000 and 2000 MN/m share a 50 MN force, giving the arch 30 MN. Reducing arch stiffness by twenty percent changes that share to 27.273 MN. This common-displacement spring analogy identifies redistribution, not a verified stress field or a dam safety conclusion. Verification: Check whether volume represents active exchange or total storage and state the averaging period for discharge. Use temperature or conservative-tracer depth profiles to identify isolated layers, then compare arrival times at withdrawal elevations to assess possible short circuiting.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":15,"enrichmentVersion":15,"stages":[{"id":"b216-v15-s1","title":"水文條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「名目停留時間與水齡」與「曲面水平投影的水推力」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Nominal residence and water age\" and \"Hydrostatic horizontal projected force\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b216-v15-01","title":"名目停留時間與水齡：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Nominal residence and water age: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「名目停留時間與水齡」如何影響翡翠水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Nominal residence and water age” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Feitsui Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"供水水庫的體積除以平均取水率得到名目周轉時間，適合比較儲水量與需求尺度。翡翠背景下的真實水齡還取決於密度分層、入流短路及死水區，所以這個商不能代表每滴水都在庫內停留相同天數。 名目時間只包含一個平均流率，若入流沿某深度快速通過，水庫可同時存在很年輕的水團與多年未交換的深層水。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「名目停留時間與水齡」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Stored volume divided by mean withdrawal gives a nominal turnover scale useful for comparing storage and demand. Actual water age also depends on stratification, short-circuit inflows and stagnant zones, so the quotient does not describe the travel time of every parcel. A nominal time contains only one averaged flow. Rapid passage along one depth can coexist with young water parcels and deep water that exchanges much more slowly, creating a broad age distribution. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Nominal residence and water age” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：V=20000000 m3; Q=4 m3/s; tau=V/Q/86400=57.87037 day。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: V=20000000 m3; Q=4 m3/s; tau=V/Q/86400=57.87037 day.","failure":"常見誤解：「名目停留時間就是每滴水完全相同的水齡」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Nominal residence time is the identical age of every water parcel\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「名目停留時間與水齡」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Nominal residence and water age”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-01-k1","title":"名目停留時間與水齡","titleEn":"Nominal residence and water age","text":"供水水庫的體積除以平均取水率得到名目周轉時間，適合比較儲水量與需求尺度。翡翠背景下的真實水齡還取決於密度分層、入流短路及死水區，所以這個商不能代表每滴水都在庫內停留相同天數。","textEn":"Stored volume divided by mean withdrawal gives a nominal turnover scale useful for comparing storage and demand. Actual water age also depends on stratification, short-circuit inflows and stagnant zones, so the quotient does not describe the travel time of every parcel.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：名目停留時間就是每滴水完全相同的水齡 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Nominal residence time is the identical age of every water parcel Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「名目停留時間與水齡」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Nominal residence and water age\" is correct?","options":["名目停留時間就是每滴水完全相同的水齡","供水水庫的體積除以平均取水率得到名目周轉時間，適合比較儲水量與需求尺度。","曲面水平水推力可直接用底壓乘全部曲面面積"],"optionsEn":["Nominal residence time is the identical age of every water parcel","Stored volume divided by mean withdrawal gives a nominal turnover scale useful for comparing storage and demand.","Horizontal hydrostatic force equals bottom pressure times the entire curved area"],"answer":1,"explanation":"供水水庫的體積除以平均取水率得到名目周轉時間，適合比較儲水量與需求尺度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Stored volume divided by mean withdrawal gives a nominal turnover scale useful for comparing storage and demand. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b216-v15-02","title":"名目停留時間與水齡：定量估算","titleEn":"Nominal residence and water age: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「名目停留時間與水齡」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Nominal residence and water age” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：V=20000000 m3; Q=4 m3/s; tau=V/Q/86400=57.87037 day。適用邊界：穩態體積與平均流量的尺度估算，沒有假設真實水庫完全混合。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: V=20000000 m3; Q=4 m3/s; tau=V/Q/86400=57.87037 day. Applicable boundary: A steady-volume and mean-flow scale estimate, without asserting complete mixing in the actual reservoir. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對體積是有效交換區還是總庫容，將流量平均時段寫清楚。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check whether volume represents active exchange or total storage and state the averaging period for discharge.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：V=20000000 m3; Q=4 m3/s; tau=V/Q/86400=57.87037 day。適用邊界：穩態體積與平均流量的尺度估算，沒有假設真實水庫完全混合。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: V=20000000 m3; Q=4 m3/s; tau=V/Q/86400=57.87037 day. Applicable boundary: A steady-volume and mean-flow scale estimate, without asserting complete mixing in the actual reservoir.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「名目停留時間與水齡」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Nominal residence and water age\", which statement holds?","options":["不必扣除孔隙水壓即可用總正向力算摩擦","密度福祿數有適用所有取水口的固定允許值","原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：V=20000000 m3; Q=4 m3/s; tau=V/Q/86400=57.87037 day。"],"optionsEn":["Friction can use total normal force without deducting pore pressure","Densimetric Froude number has one fixed permitted value for all intakes","Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: V=20000000 m3; Q=4 m3/s; tau=V/Q/86400=57.87037 day."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：V=20000000 m3; Q=4 m3/s; tau=V/Q/86400=57.87037 day。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: V=20000000 m3; Q=4 m3/s; tau=V/Q/86400=57.87037 day. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b216-v15-03","title":"名目停留時間與水齡：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Nominal residence and water age: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「名目停留時間與水齡」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Nominal residence and water age” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對體積是有效交換區還是總庫容，將流量平均時段寫清楚。用水溫或保守示蹤物的深度剖面辨識隔離水層，再比較不同取水高程的到達時間，檢查名目周轉是否掩蓋短路。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check whether volume represents active exchange or total storage and state the averaging period for discharge. Use temperature or conservative-tracer depth profiles to identify isolated layers, then compare arrival times at withdrawal elevations to assess possible short circuiting. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將有效交換體積減為原值七成，計算名目停留時間，再畫完全混合與短路兩種概念流路，說明單一平均數無法分辨何者。","observationEn":"Site practice: Reduce the actively exchanging volume to seventy percent, recalculate turnover and sketch complete mixing and short-circuit pathways. Explain why the same nominal mean cannot distinguish their very different age distributions.","failure":"注意干擾：以整座水庫體積計算後宣稱污染會在該天數全部消失，忽略長尾水齡與沉積再釋出；短路可能讓部分新入流水更早抵達取水口，兩種偏差可同時存在。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Claiming that contamination disappears after one nominal residence time ignores long age tails and sediment release. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對體積是有效交換區還是總庫容，將流量平均時段寫清楚。用水溫或保守示蹤物的深度剖面辨識隔離水層，再比較不同取水高程的到達時間，檢查名目周轉是否掩蓋短路。","textEn":"Check whether volume represents active exchange or total storage and state the averaging period for discharge. Use temperature or conservative-tracer depth profiles to identify isolated layers, then compare arrival times at withdrawal elevations to assess possible short circuiting.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將有效交換體積減為原值七成，計算名目停留時間，再畫完全混合與短路兩種概念流路，說明單一平均數無法分辨何者。","textEn":"Reduce the actively exchanging volume to seventy percent, recalculate turnover and sketch complete mixing and short-circuit pathways. Explain why the same nominal mean cannot distinguish their very different age distributions.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「名目停留時間與水齡」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Nominal residence and water age\"?","options":["核對體積是有效交換區還是總庫容，將流量平均時段寫清楚。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","水躍同時保持動量函數與機械比能不變"],"optionsEn":["Check whether volume represents active exchange or total storage and state the averaging period for discharge.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A hydraulic jump conserves both momentum function and mechanical specific energy"],"answer":0,"explanation":"核對體積是有效交換區還是總庫容，將流量平均時段寫清楚。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check whether volume represents active exchange or total storage and state the averaging period for discharge. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b216-v15-04","title":"名目停留時間與水齡：失效診斷","titleEn":"Nominal residence and water age: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「名目停留時間與水齡」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Nominal residence and water age” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"以整座水庫體積計算後宣稱污染會在該天數全部消失，忽略長尾水齡與沉積再釋出；短路可能讓部分新入流水更早抵達取水口，兩種偏差可同時存在。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Claiming that contamination disappears after one nominal residence time ignores long age tails and sediment release. Short circuiting can simultaneously deliver some newly arrived water much earlier to the intake. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：名目時間只包含一個平均流率，若入流沿某深度快速通過，水庫可同時存在很年輕的水團與多年未交換的深層水。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Rapid passage along one depth can coexist with young water parcels and deep water that exchanges much more slowly, creating a broad age distribution.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「名目停留時間就是每滴水完全相同的水齡」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Nominal residence time is the identical age of every water parcel\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"以整座水庫體積計算後宣稱污染會在該天數全部消失，忽略長尾水齡與沉積再釋出；短路可能讓部分新入流水更早抵達取水口，兩種偏差可同時存在。","textEn":"Claiming that contamination disappears after one nominal residence time ignores long age tails and sediment release. Short circuiting can simultaneously deliver some newly arrived water much earlier to the intake.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「名目停留時間與水齡」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Nominal residence and water age\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","以整座水庫體積計算後宣稱污染會在該天數全部消失，忽略長尾水齡與沉積再釋出；短路可能讓部分新入流水更早抵達取水口，兩種偏差可同時存在。","曲面水平水推力可直接用底壓乘全部曲面面積"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Claiming that contamination disappears after one nominal residence time ignores long age tails and sediment release.","Horizontal hydrostatic force equals bottom pressure times the entire curved area"],"answer":1,"explanation":"以整座水庫體積計算後宣稱污染會在該天數全部消失，忽略長尾水齡與沉積再釋出；短路可能讓部分新入流水更早抵達取水口，兩種偏差可同時存在。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Claiming that contamination disappears after one nominal residence time ignores long age tails and sediment release. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b216-v15-05","title":"曲面水平投影的水推力：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Hydrostatic horizontal projected force: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-04"],"objective":"說明「曲面水平投影的水推力」如何影響翡翠水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Hydrostatic horizontal projected force” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Feitsui Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"曲面上的水壓始終沿表面法線，水平分力可用垂直投影面積積分取得。翡翠拱壩背景的示範只計一塊假想投影條帶，不把合力直接當作壩基剪力，也不忽略曲面另外可能承受的垂直分量。 積分可用水平分力逐點相加，也可先投影再積分，兩種路徑在靜水條件下應一致，這提供幾何模型的獨立檢核。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「曲面水平投影的水推力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Pressure acts normally to a curved surface, while its horizontal component follows integration over the vertical projection. This exercise treats a hypothetical projected strip rather than equating the result to foundation shear or discarding other force components on the curved body. The horizontal force may be integrated from local components or calculated after projection. Under hydrostatic conditions these routes must agree, providing an independent geometric check without assuming a structural load path. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Hydrostatic horizontal projected force” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; b=10 m; H=40 m; F=rho g b H2/2/1e6=78.48 MN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; b=10 m; H=40 m; F=rho g b H2/2/1e6=78.48 MN.","failure":"常見誤解：「曲面水平水推力可直接用底壓乘全部曲面面積」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Horizontal hydrostatic force equals bottom pressure times the entire curved area\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「曲面水平投影的水推力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Hydrostatic horizontal projected force”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-05-k1","title":"曲面水平投影的水推力","titleEn":"Hydrostatic horizontal projected force","text":"曲面上的水壓始終沿表面法線，水平分力可用垂直投影面積積分取得。翡翠拱壩背景的示範只計一塊假想投影條帶，不把合力直接當作壩基剪力，也不忽略曲面另外可能承受的垂直分量。","textEn":"Pressure acts normally to a curved surface, while its horizontal component follows integration over the vertical projection. This exercise treats a hypothetical projected strip rather than equating the result to foundation shear or discarding other force components on the curved body.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：曲面水平水推力可直接用底壓乘全部曲面面積 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Horizontal hydrostatic force equals bottom pressure times the entire curved area Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「曲面水平投影的水推力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Hydrostatic horizontal projected force\" is correct?","options":["曲面水平水推力可直接用底壓乘全部曲面面積","一條力路變軟不會改變另一條力路的分力","曲面上的水壓始終沿表面法線，水平分力可用垂直投影面積積分取得。"],"optionsEn":["Horizontal hydrostatic force equals bottom pressure times the entire curved area","Softening one load path leaves force in the other path unchanged","Pressure acts normally to a curved surface, while its horizontal component follows integration over the vertical projection."],"answer":2,"explanation":"曲面上的水壓始終沿表面法線，水平分力可用垂直投影面積積分取得。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Pressure acts normally to a curved surface, while its horizontal component follows integration over the vertical projection. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b216-v15-06","title":"曲面水平投影的水推力：定量估算","titleEn":"Hydrostatic horizontal projected force: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「曲面水平投影的水推力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Hydrostatic horizontal projected force” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; b=10 m; H=40 m; F=rho g b H2/2/1e6=78.48 MN。適用邊界：頂端位於自由液面的垂直矩形投影，靜水且尾水壓未計。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; b=10 m; H=40 m; F=rho g b H2/2/1e6=78.48 MN. Applicable boundary: A vertical rectangular projection starting at the free surface, with hydrostatic water and no downstream pressure. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：畫出隨深度線性增加的壓力三角形，用底壓乘面積再除二重算合力。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Draw the triangular pressure distribution and independently recover force from half the base pressure times projected area.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; b=10 m; H=40 m; F=rho g b H2/2/1e6=78.48 MN。適用邊界：頂端位於自由液面的垂直矩形投影，靜水且尾水壓未計。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; b=10 m; H=40 m; F=rho g b H2/2/1e6=78.48 MN. Applicable boundary: A vertical rectangular projection starting at the free surface, with hydrostatic water and no downstream pressure.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「曲面水平投影的水推力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Hydrostatic horizontal projected force\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; b=10 m; H=40 m; F=rho g b H2/2/1e6=78.48 MN。","單塊自由伸長必然等於接縫實際開口增量","只知道水位增量就能判斷剩餘蓄洪空間"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; b=10 m; H=40 m; F=rho g b H2/2/1e6=78.48 MN.","Free expansion of one block necessarily equals actual joint opening","Knowing only level increment establishes remaining flood-storage capacity"],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; b=10 m; H=40 m; F=rho g b H2/2/1e6=78.48 MN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; b=10 m; H=40 m; F=rho g b H2/2/1e6=78.48 MN. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b216-v15-07","title":"曲面水平投影的水推力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Hydrostatic horizontal projected force: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「曲面水平投影的水推力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Hydrostatic horizontal projected force” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"畫出隨深度線性增加的壓力三角形，用底壓乘面積再除二重算合力。核對作用點在水深下方三分之二位置，並列出曲面法線方向與水平投影之間的轉換，避免面積重複計入。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Draw the triangular pressure distribution and independently recover force from half the base pressure times projected area. Check that the resultant acts two thirds of the depth below the surface, then distinguish actual curved area from its horizontal-force projection. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：把水深從四十公尺增至四十八公尺，計算合力倍率並比較壓力倍率，解釋為何總推力增加快於底壓，以及投影寬度假設有何影響。","observationEn":"Site practice: Increase depth from forty to forty-eight metres, compare force and bottom-pressure multipliers, and explain why resultant force grows faster. State how the assumed projected width limits the interpretation of the comparison.","failure":"注意干擾：把平均水壓誤設為底部最大水壓會使合力加倍；又若把投影條帶的合力直接均分給所有拱圈，便忽略深度變化與三維承載分配，產生錯誤應力圖。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using bottom pressure as average pressure doubles the resultant. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"畫出隨深度線性增加的壓力三角形，用底壓乘面積再除二重算合力。核對作用點在水深下方三分之二位置，並列出曲面法線方向與水平投影之間的轉換，避免面積重複計入。","textEn":"Draw the triangular pressure distribution and independently recover force from half the base pressure times projected area. Check that the resultant acts two thirds of the depth below the surface, then distinguish actual curved area from its horizontal-force projection.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"把水深從四十公尺增至四十八公尺，計算合力倍率並比較壓力倍率，解釋為何總推力增加快於底壓，以及投影寬度假設有何影響。","textEn":"Increase depth from forty to forty-eight metres, compare force and bottom-pressure multipliers, and explain why resultant force grows faster. State how the assumed projected width limits the interpretation of the comparison.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「曲面水平投影的水推力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Hydrostatic horizontal projected force\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","畫出隨深度線性增加的壓力三角形，用底壓乘面積再除二重算合力。","濁度數值可以直接當作每立方公尺固體公斤數"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Draw the triangular pressure distribution and independently recover force from half the base pressure times projected area.","A turbidity value directly equals kilograms of solids per cubic metre"],"answer":1,"explanation":"畫出隨深度線性增加的壓力三角形，用底壓乘面積再除二重算合力。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Draw the triangular pressure distribution and independently recover force from half the base pressure times projected area. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b216-v15-08","title":"曲面水平投影的水推力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Hydrostatic horizontal projected force: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「曲面水平投影的水推力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Hydrostatic horizontal projected force” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把平均水壓誤設為底部最大水壓會使合力加倍；又若把投影條帶的合力直接均分給所有拱圈，便忽略深度變化與三維承載分配，產生錯誤應力圖。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using bottom pressure as average pressure doubles the resultant. Distributing the projected-strip force equally among every arch ring then ignores depth variation and three-dimensional load sharing, producing a misleading stress picture. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：積分可用水平分力逐點相加，也可先投影再積分，兩種路徑在靜水條件下應一致，這提供幾何模型的獨立檢核。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Under hydrostatic conditions these routes must agree, providing an independent geometric check without assuming a structural load path.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「曲面水平水推力可直接用底壓乘全部曲面面積」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Horizontal hydrostatic force equals bottom pressure times the entire curved area\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把平均水壓誤設為底部最大水壓會使合力加倍；又若把投影條帶的合力直接均分給所有拱圈，便忽略深度變化與三維承載分配，產生錯誤應力圖。","textEn":"Using bottom pressure as average pressure doubles the resultant. Distributing the projected-strip force equally among every arch ring then ignores depth variation and three-dimensional load sharing, producing a misleading stress picture.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「曲面水平投影的水推力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Hydrostatic horizontal projected force\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","一條力路變軟不會改變另一條力路的分力","把平均水壓誤設為底部最大水壓會使合力加倍；又若把投影條帶的合力直接均分給所有拱圈，便忽略深度變化與三維承載分配，產生錯誤應力圖。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Softening one load path leaves force in the other path unchanged","Using bottom pressure as average pressure doubles the resultant."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把平均水壓誤設為底部最大水壓會使合力加倍；又若把投影條帶的合力直接均分給所有拱圈，便忽略深度變化與三維承載分配，產生錯誤應力圖。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using bottom pressure as average pressure doubles the resultant. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b216-v15-s2","title":"水力機制、材料與定量模型","titleEn":"Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models","description":"本階段聚焦「拱與懸臂剛度分力」與「岩盤層面有效正向力」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Arch and cantilever load sharing\" and \"Effective force on rock bedding\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b216-v15-09","title":"拱與懸臂剛度分力：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Arch and cantilever load sharing: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-08"],"objective":"說明「拱與懸臂剛度分力」如何影響翡翠水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Arch and cantilever load sharing” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Feitsui Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"雙曲率壩的水平拱作用與垂直懸臂作用共同抵抗水壓。用同位移的兩個並聯彈簧表示這兩條力路，可看出較硬路徑分擔更多荷載，但這只是相容變形概念，不能把兩彈簧視為互不影響的真實壩塊。 總剛度相加來自同位移條件，與串聯彈簧的同力條件不同；分力比恰為剛度比，只在這個線性並聯模型成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「拱與懸臂剛度分力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Horizontal arch and vertical cantilever action jointly resist pressure. Parallel springs with a common displacement illustrate why the stiffer load path attracts more force, while remaining an analogy rather than two independent physical blocks of a real double-curvature dam. Adding stiffnesses follows from common displacement, unlike the common force of series springs. The force ratio equals the stiffness ratio only within this linear parallel model, not as a universal dam property. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Arch and cantilever load sharing” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：ka=3000 MN/m; kc=2000 MN/m; F=50 MN; Fa=F ka/(ka+kc)=30 MN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: ka=3000 MN/m; kc=2000 MN/m; F=50 MN; Fa=F ka/(ka+kc)=30 MN.","failure":"常見誤解：「一條力路變軟不會改變另一條力路的分力」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Softening one load path leaves force in the other path unchanged\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「拱與懸臂剛度分力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Arch and cantilever load sharing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-09-k1","title":"拱與懸臂剛度分力","titleEn":"Arch and cantilever load sharing","text":"雙曲率壩的水平拱作用與垂直懸臂作用共同抵抗水壓。用同位移的兩個並聯彈簧表示這兩條力路，可看出較硬路徑分擔更多荷載，但這只是相容變形概念，不能把兩彈簧視為互不影響的真實壩塊。","textEn":"Horizontal arch and vertical cantilever action jointly resist pressure. Parallel springs with a common displacement illustrate why the stiffer load path attracts more force, while remaining an analogy rather than two independent physical blocks of a real double-curvature dam.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：一條力路變軟不會改變另一條力路的分力 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Softening one load path leaves force in the other path unchanged Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「拱與懸臂剛度分力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Arch and cantilever load sharing\" is correct?","options":["雙曲率壩的水平拱作用與垂直懸臂作用共同抵抗水壓。","一條力路變軟不會改變另一條力路的分力","不必扣除孔隙水壓即可用總正向力算摩擦"],"optionsEn":["Horizontal arch and vertical cantilever action jointly resist pressure.","Softening one load path leaves force in the other path unchanged","Friction can use total normal force without deducting pore pressure"],"answer":0,"explanation":"雙曲率壩的水平拱作用與垂直懸臂作用共同抵抗水壓。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Horizontal arch and vertical cantilever action jointly resist pressure. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b216-v15-10","title":"拱與懸臂剛度分力：定量估算","titleEn":"Arch and cantilever load sharing: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「拱與懸臂剛度分力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Arch and cantilever load sharing” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：ka=3000 MN/m; kc=2000 MN/m; F=50 MN; Fa=F ka/(ka+kc)=30 MN。適用邊界：線性並聯與共同位移，只示範力路分配，不提供局部應力。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: ka=3000 MN/m; kc=2000 MN/m; F=50 MN; Fa=F ka/(ka+kc)=30 MN. Applicable boundary: Linear parallel paths with shared displacement illustrate force distribution without predicting local stresses. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：分別用總剛度求位移，再以兩個剛度乘位移重建分力，確認分力相加等於外力。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Find displacement from total stiffness, recover each force from stiffness times displacement and verify equilibrium.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：ka=3000 MN/m; kc=2000 MN/m; F=50 MN; Fa=F ka/(ka+kc)=30 MN。適用邊界：線性並聯與共同位移，只示範力路分配，不提供局部應力。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: ka=3000 MN/m; kc=2000 MN/m; F=50 MN; Fa=F ka/(ka+kc)=30 MN. Applicable boundary: Linear parallel paths with shared displacement illustrate force distribution without predicting local stresses.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「拱與懸臂剛度分力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Arch and cantilever load sharing\", which statement holds?","options":["密度福祿數有適用所有取水口的固定允許值","原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：ka=3000 MN/m; kc=2000 MN/m; F=50 MN; Fa=F ka/(ka+kc)=30 MN。","水躍同時保持動量函數與機械比能不變"],"optionsEn":["Densimetric Froude number has one fixed permitted value for all intakes","Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: ka=3000 MN/m; kc=2000 MN/m; F=50 MN; Fa=F ka/(ka+kc)=30 MN.","A hydraulic jump conserves both momentum function and mechanical specific energy"],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：ka=3000 MN/m; kc=2000 MN/m; F=50 MN; Fa=F ka/(ka+kc)=30 MN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: ka=3000 MN/m; kc=2000 MN/m; F=50 MN; Fa=F ka/(ka+kc)=30 MN. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b216-v15-11","title":"拱與懸臂剛度分力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Arch and cantilever load sharing: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「拱與懸臂剛度分力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Arch and cantilever load sharing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"分別用總剛度求位移，再以兩個剛度乘位移重建分力，確認分力相加等於外力。改變其中一條路徑剛度時，同時記錄另一條分力如何增加，並說明真實壩體需要何種接縫及基礎資料。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Find displacement from total stiffness, recover each force from stiffness times displacement and verify equilibrium. Change one path stiffness while tracking the other force, then identify joint and foundation information required to move beyond this simple compatibility analogy. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：把拱剛度降至二千四百兆牛頓每公尺，重新求兩條分力及共同位移，畫出荷載轉移方向，指出這項結果仍不能判定局部裂縫是否擴展。","observationEn":"Site practice: Reduce arch stiffness to twenty-four hundred meganewtons per metre, recalculate both forces and displacement, and draw redistribution. Explain why these results alone cannot determine whether a local crack will propagate.","failure":"注意干擾：認為一條力路變軟只會減少整體受力，漏掉荷載向另一力路轉移；若仍保留原分力卻改用新剛度，則位移不相容，模型已失去共同變形的基本前提。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Softening one path does not simply remove load; it redirects force into the other path. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"分別用總剛度求位移，再以兩個剛度乘位移重建分力，確認分力相加等於外力。改變其中一條路徑剛度時，同時記錄另一條分力如何增加，並說明真實壩體需要何種接縫及基礎資料。","textEn":"Find displacement from total stiffness, recover each force from stiffness times displacement and verify equilibrium. Change one path stiffness while tracking the other force, then identify joint and foundation information required to move beyond this simple compatibility analogy.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"把拱剛度降至二千四百兆牛頓每公尺，重新求兩條分力及共同位移，畫出荷載轉移方向，指出這項結果仍不能判定局部裂縫是否擴展。","textEn":"Reduce arch stiffness to twenty-four hundred meganewtons per metre, recalculate both forces and displacement, and draw redistribution. Explain why these results alone cannot determine whether a local crack will propagate.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「拱與懸臂剛度分力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Arch and cantilever load sharing\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","兩股流量不同時仍可把濃度直接取算術平均","分別用總剛度求位移，再以兩個剛度乘位移重建分力，確認分力相加等於外力。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Two concentrations can be averaged arithmetically even when source flows differ","Find displacement from total stiffness, recover each force from stiffness times displacement and verify equilibrium."],"answer":2,"explanation":"分別用總剛度求位移，再以兩個剛度乘位移重建分力，確認分力相加等於外力。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Find displacement from total stiffness, recover each force from stiffness times displacement and verify equilibrium. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b216-v15-12","title":"拱與懸臂剛度分力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Arch and cantilever load sharing: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「拱與懸臂剛度分力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Arch and cantilever load sharing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"認為一條力路變軟只會減少整體受力，漏掉荷載向另一力路轉移；若仍保留原分力卻改用新剛度，則位移不相容，模型已失去共同變形的基本前提。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Softening one path does not simply remove load; it redirects force into the other path. Keeping old force shares with new stiffnesses creates incompatible displacements and violates the model's central assumption. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：總剛度相加來自同位移條件，與串聯彈簧的同力條件不同；分力比恰為剛度比，只在這個線性並聯模型成立。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The force ratio equals the stiffness ratio only within this linear parallel model, not as a universal dam property.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「一條力路變軟不會改變另一條力路的分力」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Softening one load path leaves force in the other path unchanged\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"認為一條力路變軟只會減少整體受力，漏掉荷載向另一力路轉移；若仍保留原分力卻改用新剛度，則位移不相容，模型已失去共同變形的基本前提。","textEn":"Softening one path does not simply remove load; it redirects force into the other path. Keeping old force shares with new stiffnesses creates incompatible displacements and violates the model's central assumption.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「拱與懸臂剛度分力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Arch and cantilever load sharing\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["認為一條力路變軟只會減少整體受力，漏掉荷載向另一力路轉移；若仍保留原分力卻改用新剛度，則位移不相容，模型已失去共同變形的基本前提。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","不必扣除孔隙水壓即可用總正向力算摩擦"],"optionsEn":["Softening one path does not simply remove load; it redirects force into the other path.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Friction can use total normal force without deducting pore pressure"],"answer":0,"explanation":"認為一條力路變軟只會減少整體受力，漏掉荷載向另一力路轉移；若仍保留原分力卻改用新剛度，則位移不相容，模型已失去共同變形的基本前提。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Softening one path does not simply remove load; it redirects force into the other path. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b216-v15-13","title":"岩盤層面有效正向力：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Effective force on rock bedding: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-12"],"objective":"說明「岩盤層面有效正向力」如何影響翡翠水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Effective force on rock bedding” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Feitsui Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"拱推力進入有層面的岩盤時，抗滑摩擦取決於扣除孔隙水壓後的有效正向力。假想單一平面模型把水壓作用面積明列出來，讓學員看見排水如何改變有效力，而不是把總壓力全部當成可用摩擦來源。 孔壓作用的方向垂直層面，水壓與總正向力使用相同符號約定才能相減；孔壓上升不是直接增加摩擦的壓緊力。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「岩盤層面有效正向力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Thrust entering bedded rock mobilizes friction according to normal force remaining after water pressure is deducted. A single-plane model explicitly includes pressurized area, showing how drainage changes effective force rather than treating total compression as entirely available for friction. Pore pressure acts normal to the bedding plane, so it must use a compatible sign convention with total normal force. Increasing water pressure is not additional clamping force available to mobilize friction. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Effective force on rock bedding” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：N=80 MN; u=0.3 MPa; A=100 m2; phi=30 deg; R=(N-uA)tan(phi)=28.86751 MN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: N=80 MN; u=0.3 MPa; A=100 m2; phi=30 deg; R=(N-uA)tan(phi)=28.86751 MN.","failure":"常見誤解：「不必扣除孔隙水壓即可用總正向力算摩擦」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Friction can use total normal force without deducting pore pressure\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「岩盤層面有效正向力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Effective force on rock bedding”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-13-k1","title":"岩盤層面有效正向力","titleEn":"Effective force on rock bedding","text":"拱推力進入有層面的岩盤時，抗滑摩擦取決於扣除孔隙水壓後的有效正向力。假想單一平面模型把水壓作用面積明列出來，讓學員看見排水如何改變有效力，而不是把總壓力全部當成可用摩擦來源。","textEn":"Thrust entering bedded rock mobilizes friction according to normal force remaining after water pressure is deducted. A single-plane model explicitly includes pressurized area, showing how drainage changes effective force rather than treating total compression as entirely available for friction.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：不必扣除孔隙水壓即可用總正向力算摩擦 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Friction can use total normal force without deducting pore pressure Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「岩盤層面有效正向力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Effective force on rock bedding\" is correct?","options":["不必扣除孔隙水壓即可用總正向力算摩擦","拱推力進入有層面的岩盤時，抗滑摩擦取決於扣除孔隙水壓後的有效正向力。","單塊自由伸長必然等於接縫實際開口增量"],"optionsEn":["Friction can use total normal force without deducting pore pressure","Thrust entering bedded rock mobilizes friction according to normal force remaining after water pressure is deducted.","Free expansion of one block necessarily equals actual joint opening"],"answer":1,"explanation":"拱推力進入有層面的岩盤時，抗滑摩擦取決於扣除孔隙水壓後的有效正向力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Thrust entering bedded rock mobilizes friction according to normal force remaining after water pressure is deducted. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b216-v15-14","title":"岩盤層面有效正向力：定量估算","titleEn":"Effective force on rock bedding: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「岩盤層面有效正向力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Effective force on rock bedding” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：N=80 MN; u=0.3 MPa; A=100 m2; phi=30 deg; R=(N-uA)tan(phi)=28.86751 MN。適用邊界：不計黏聚與側向約束，孔壓均勻；只算摩擦抗力不是安全係數。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: N=80 MN; u=0.3 MPa; A=100 m2; phi=30 deg; R=(N-uA)tan(phi)=28.86751 MN. Applicable boundary: No cohesion or lateral confinement, with uniform pore pressure; the result is frictional resistance, not a safety factor. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：先核對兆帕乘平方公尺等於兆牛頓，再以測壓管代表範圍估算壓力分布。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Verify that megapascals times square metres produce meganewtons, then examine how piezometers represent the pressure field.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：N=80 MN; u=0.3 MPa; A=100 m2; phi=30 deg; R=(N-uA)tan(phi)=28.86751 MN。適用邊界：不計黏聚與側向約束，孔壓均勻；只算摩擦抗力不是安全係數。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: N=80 MN; u=0.3 MPa; A=100 m2; phi=30 deg; R=(N-uA)tan(phi)=28.86751 MN. Applicable boundary: No cohesion or lateral confinement, with uniform pore pressure; the result is frictional resistance, not a safety factor.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「岩盤層面有效正向力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Effective force on rock bedding\", which statement holds?","options":["只知道水位增量就能判斷剩餘蓄洪空間","濁度數值可以直接當作每立方公尺固體公斤數","原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：N=80 MN; u=0.3 MPa; A=100 m2; phi=30 deg; R=(N-uA)tan(phi)=28.86751 MN。"],"optionsEn":["Knowing only level increment establishes remaining flood-storage capacity","A turbidity value directly equals kilograms of solids per cubic metre","Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: N=80 MN; u=0.3 MPa; A=100 m2; phi=30 deg; R=(N-uA)tan(phi)=28.86751 MN."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：N=80 MN; u=0.3 MPa; A=100 m2; phi=30 deg; R=(N-uA)tan(phi)=28.86751 MN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: N=80 MN; u=0.3 MPa; A=100 m2; phi=30 deg; R=(N-uA)tan(phi)=28.86751 MN. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b216-v15-15","title":"岩盤層面有效正向力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Effective force on rock bedding: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「岩盤層面有效正向力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Effective force on rock bedding” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"先核對兆帕乘平方公尺等於兆牛頓，再以測壓管代表範圍估算壓力分布。比較排水前後孔壓與位移趨勢，注意單一測點不能代表整條層面，並另列未知的剪力需求與力矩。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Verify that megapascals times square metres produce meganewtons, then examine how piezometers represent the pressure field. Compare pressure and movement before and after drainage, noting that one point cannot characterize the entire plane and that shear demand remains unspecified. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：把均勻孔壓提高到零點四兆帕，重算摩擦抗力並畫孔壓與抗力關係，再討論何時有效正向力趨近零會使簡化接觸假設失效。","observationEn":"Site practice: Raise uniform pore pressure to zero point four megapascals, recalculate resistance and plot its pressure dependence. Discuss why the contact assumption breaks down as effective normal force approaches zero.","failure":"注意干擾：把總正向力直接乘摩擦係數會高估抗力；若測壓點位在局部低壓排水孔旁，可能漏掉遠處高壓區，使看似合理的平均孔壓掩蓋層面有效力不足。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Multiplying total normal force by friction coefficient overestimates resistance. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"先核對兆帕乘平方公尺等於兆牛頓，再以測壓管代表範圍估算壓力分布。比較排水前後孔壓與位移趨勢，注意單一測點不能代表整條層面，並另列未知的剪力需求與力矩。","textEn":"Verify that megapascals times square metres produce meganewtons, then examine how piezometers represent the pressure field. Compare pressure and movement before and after drainage, noting that one point cannot characterize the entire plane and that shear demand remains unspecified.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"把均勻孔壓提高到零點四兆帕，重算摩擦抗力並畫孔壓與抗力關係，再討論何時有效正向力趨近零會使簡化接觸假設失效。","textEn":"Raise uniform pore pressure to zero point four megapascals, recalculate resistance and plot its pressure dependence. Discuss why the contact assumption breaks down as effective normal force approaches zero.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「岩盤層面有效正向力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Effective force on rock bedding\"?","options":["先核對兆帕乘平方公尺等於兆牛頓，再以測壓管代表範圍估算壓力分布。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","名目停留時間就是每滴水完全相同的水齡"],"optionsEn":["Verify that megapascals times square metres produce meganewtons, then examine how piezometers represent the pressure field.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Nominal residence time is the identical age of every water parcel"],"answer":0,"explanation":"先核對兆帕乘平方公尺等於兆牛頓，再以測壓管代表範圍估算壓力分布。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Verify that megapascals times square metres produce meganewtons, then examine how piezometers represent the pressure field. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b216-v15-16","title":"岩盤層面有效正向力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Effective force on rock bedding: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「岩盤層面有效正向力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Effective force on rock bedding” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把總正向力直接乘摩擦係數會高估抗力；若測壓點位在局部低壓排水孔旁，可能漏掉遠處高壓區，使看似合理的平均孔壓掩蓋層面有效力不足。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Multiplying total normal force by friction coefficient overestimates resistance. A sensor beside a local drain may miss a remote high-pressure zone, so an apparently reasonable average can conceal reduced effective contact force. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：孔壓作用的方向垂直層面，水壓與總正向力使用相同符號約定才能相減；孔壓上升不是直接增加摩擦的壓緊力。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Increasing water pressure is not additional clamping force available to mobilize friction.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「不必扣除孔隙水壓即可用總正向力算摩擦」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Friction can use total normal force without deducting pore pressure\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把總正向力直接乘摩擦係數會高估抗力；若測壓點位在局部低壓排水孔旁，可能漏掉遠處高壓區，使看似合理的平均孔壓掩蓋層面有效力不足。","textEn":"Multiplying total normal force by friction coefficient overestimates resistance. A sensor beside a local drain may miss a remote high-pressure zone, so an apparently reasonable average can conceal reduced effective contact force.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「岩盤層面有效正向力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Effective force on rock bedding\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","把總正向力直接乘摩擦係數會高估抗力；若測壓點位在局部低壓排水孔旁，可能漏掉遠處高壓區，使看似合理的平均孔壓掩蓋層面有效力不足。","單塊自由伸長必然等於接縫實際開口增量"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Multiplying total normal force by friction coefficient overestimates resistance.","Free expansion of one block necessarily equals actual joint opening"],"answer":1,"explanation":"把總正向力直接乘摩擦係數會高估抗力；若測壓點位在局部低壓排水孔旁，可能漏掉遠處高壓區，使看似合理的平均孔壓掩蓋層面有效力不足。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Multiplying total normal force by friction coefficient overestimates resistance. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b216-v15-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「溫度變形與接縫開度」與「密度分層與取水慣性」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Thermal movement and joint gap\" and \"Stratification and withdrawal inertia\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b216-v15-17","title":"溫度變形與接縫開度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Thermal movement and joint gap: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-16"],"objective":"說明「溫度變形與接縫開度」如何影響翡翠水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Thermal movement and joint gap” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Feitsui Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"拱壩接縫的相對開合會受到塊體溫度、拘束及水壓共同影響。自由熱伸縮長度可以當作幾何尺度，但不能直接等同實際縫寬；縫面接觸後可能傳力，張開後傳力條件又會改變，形成非線性問題。 若接縫兩側都朝縫面伸長，相對閉合量可能大於單塊伸長；若一起平移則縫寬不變，顯示絕對與相對位移不同。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「溫度變形與接縫開度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Relative joint movement responds to block temperature, restraint and hydraulic loading. Free thermal movement provides a geometric scale rather than the actual gap, because contact can transmit force while opening changes the load path and introduces nonlinearity. When both blocks expand toward a joint, relative closure can exceed one block expansion. Common translation leaves gap unchanged, demonstrating why absolute movement and relative aperture are different observables. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Thermal movement and joint gap” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=24 m; dT=15 K; dL=alpha L dT*1000=3.6 mm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=24 m; dT=15 K; dL=alpha L dT*1000=3.6 mm.","failure":"常見誤解：「單塊自由伸長必然等於接縫實際開口增量」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Free expansion of one block necessarily equals actual joint opening\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「溫度變形與接縫開度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Thermal movement and joint gap”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-17-k1","title":"溫度變形與接縫開度","titleEn":"Thermal movement and joint gap","text":"拱壩接縫的相對開合會受到塊體溫度、拘束及水壓共同影響。自由熱伸縮長度可以當作幾何尺度，但不能直接等同實際縫寬；縫面接觸後可能傳力，張開後傳力條件又會改變，形成非線性問題。","textEn":"Relative joint movement responds to block temperature, restraint and hydraulic loading. Free thermal movement provides a geometric scale rather than the actual gap, because contact can transmit force while opening changes the load path and introduces nonlinearity.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：單塊自由伸長必然等於接縫實際開口增量 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Free expansion of one block necessarily equals actual joint opening Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「溫度變形與接縫開度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Thermal movement and joint gap\" is correct?","options":["單塊自由伸長必然等於接縫實際開口增量","密度福祿數有適用所有取水口的固定允許值","拱壩接縫的相對開合會受到塊體溫度、拘束及水壓共同影響。"],"optionsEn":["Free expansion of one block necessarily equals actual joint opening","Densimetric Froude number has one fixed permitted value for all intakes","Relative joint movement responds to block temperature, restraint and hydraulic loading."],"answer":2,"explanation":"拱壩接縫的相對開合會受到塊體溫度、拘束及水壓共同影響。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Relative joint movement responds to block temperature, restraint and hydraulic loading. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b216-v15-18","title":"溫度變形與接縫開度：定量估算","titleEn":"Thermal movement and joint gap: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「溫度變形與接縫開度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Thermal movement and joint gap” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=24 m; dT=15 K; dL=alpha L dT*1000=3.6 mm。適用邊界：單一塊體自由伸長，未加入兩側塊體、拘束及初始縫寬。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=24 m; dT=15 K; dL=alpha L dT*1000=3.6 mm. Applicable boundary: Free expansion of one block, excluding adjacent blocks, restraint and initial gap. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：將縫計與附近溫度計同步繪圖，核對量測方向與正負號，再分別辨識日週期與季節週期。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Plot joint and temperature measurements synchronously, checking sensor direction and sign before distinguishing daily from seasonal cycles.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=24 m; dT=15 K; dL=alpha L dT*1000=3.6 mm。適用邊界：單一塊體自由伸長，未加入兩側塊體、拘束及初始縫寬。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=24 m; dT=15 K; dL=alpha L dT*1000=3.6 mm. Applicable boundary: Free expansion of one block, excluding adjacent blocks, restraint and initial gap.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「溫度變形與接縫開度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Thermal movement and joint gap\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=24 m; dT=15 K; dL=alpha L dT*1000=3.6 mm。","水躍同時保持動量函數與機械比能不變","兩股流量不同時仍可把濃度直接取算術平均"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=24 m; dT=15 K; dL=alpha L dT*1000=3.6 mm.","A hydraulic jump conserves both momentum function and mechanical specific energy","Two concentrations can be averaged arithmetically even when source flows differ"],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=24 m; dT=15 K; dL=alpha L dT*1000=3.6 mm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=24 m; dT=15 K; dL=alpha L dT*1000=3.6 mm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b216-v15-19","title":"溫度變形與接縫開度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Thermal movement and joint gap: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「溫度變形與接縫開度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Thermal movement and joint gap” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"將縫計與附近溫度計同步繪圖，核對量測方向與正負號，再分別辨識日週期與季節週期。以兩側塊體的相對運動重建縫寬，不能把單側絕對位移直接當成開度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Plot joint and temperature measurements synchronously, checking sensor direction and sign before distinguishing daily from seasonal cycles. Reconstruct gap from the relative motion of both sides rather than treating one block's absolute displacement as joint opening. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：畫兩側等長塊體同時升溫的幾何圖，指定固定端位置後求相對位移，再與單側伸長比較，說明接縫初始間隙對是否接觸的影響。","observationEn":"Site practice: Sketch two equal blocks warming together, specify their fixed ends and derive relative movement. Compare it with single-block expansion and explain how the initial gap determines whether contact develops.","failure":"注意干擾：把自由伸長全數加到縫寬而不考慮方向，可能把閉合預測成張開；若縫面已接觸仍用同一直線關係外推，就會忽略接觸壓力與剛度突然改變。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Adding all free expansion to gap without checking direction can predict opening where closure occurs. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"將縫計與附近溫度計同步繪圖，核對量測方向與正負號，再分別辨識日週期與季節週期。以兩側塊體的相對運動重建縫寬，不能把單側絕對位移直接當成開度。","textEn":"Plot joint and temperature measurements synchronously, checking sensor direction and sign before distinguishing daily from seasonal cycles. Reconstruct gap from the relative motion of both sides rather than treating one block's absolute displacement as joint opening.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"畫兩側等長塊體同時升溫的幾何圖，指定固定端位置後求相對位移，再與單側伸長比較，說明接縫初始間隙對是否接觸的影響。","textEn":"Sketch two equal blocks warming together, specify their fixed ends and derive relative movement. Compare it with single-block expansion and explain how the initial gap determines whether contact develops.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「溫度變形與接縫開度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Thermal movement and joint gap\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","將縫計與附近溫度計同步繪圖，核對量測方向與正負號，再分別辨識日週期與季節週期。","曲面水平水推力可直接用底壓乘全部曲面面積"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Plot joint and temperature measurements synchronously, checking sensor direction and sign before distinguishing daily from seasonal cycles.","Horizontal hydrostatic force equals bottom pressure times the entire curved area"],"answer":1,"explanation":"將縫計與附近溫度計同步繪圖，核對量測方向與正負號，再分別辨識日週期與季節週期。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Plot joint and temperature measurements synchronously, checking sensor direction and sign before distinguishing daily from seasonal cycles. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b216-v15-20","title":"溫度變形與接縫開度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Thermal movement and joint gap: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「溫度變形與接縫開度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Thermal movement and joint gap” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把自由伸長全數加到縫寬而不考慮方向，可能把閉合預測成張開；若縫面已接觸仍用同一直線關係外推，就會忽略接觸壓力與剛度突然改變。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Adding all free expansion to gap without checking direction can predict opening where closure occurs. Continuing the same linear relation after contact ignores the resulting contact pressure and abrupt change in stiffness. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若接縫兩側都朝縫面伸長，相對閉合量可能大於單塊伸長；若一起平移則縫寬不變，顯示絕對與相對位移不同。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Common translation leaves gap unchanged, demonstrating why absolute movement and relative aperture are different observables.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「單塊自由伸長必然等於接縫實際開口增量」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Free expansion of one block necessarily equals actual joint opening\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把自由伸長全數加到縫寬而不考慮方向，可能把閉合預測成張開；若縫面已接觸仍用同一直線關係外推，就會忽略接觸壓力與剛度突然改變。","textEn":"Adding all free expansion to gap without checking direction can predict opening where closure occurs. Continuing the same linear relation after contact ignores the resulting contact pressure and abrupt change in stiffness.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「溫度變形與接縫開度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Thermal movement and joint gap\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","密度福祿數有適用所有取水口的固定允許值","把自由伸長全數加到縫寬而不考慮方向，可能把閉合預測成張開；若縫面已接觸仍用同一直線關係外推，就會忽略接觸壓力與剛度突然改變。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Densimetric Froude number has one fixed permitted value for all intakes","Adding all free expansion to gap without checking direction can predict opening where closure occurs."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把自由伸長全數加到縫寬而不考慮方向，可能把閉合預測成張開；若縫面已接觸仍用同一直線關係外推，就會忽略接觸壓力與剛度突然改變。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Adding all free expansion to gap without checking direction can predict opening where closure occurs. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b216-v15-21","title":"密度分層與取水慣性：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Stratification and withdrawal inertia: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-20"],"objective":"說明「密度分層與取水慣性」如何影響翡翠水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Stratification and withdrawal inertia” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Feitsui Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"水庫冷暖水層的密度差提供恢復浮力，取水流速則會拉動界面。以約化重力及密度福祿數比較慣性與浮力，可討論選擇性取水是否容易擾動水層，但實際取水形狀、界面厚度與三維流場仍不可省略。 約化重力只保留密度差造成的浮力尺度，不能用完整重力取代；其平方根與水深共同形成可與流速比較的特徵速度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「密度分層與取水慣性」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Density contrast between warm and cool layers supplies restoring buoyancy while withdrawal velocity disturbs the interface. Reduced gravity and a densimetric Froude number compare inertia with buoyancy, without resolving intake geometry, interface thickness or the three-dimensional withdrawal field. Reduced gravity retains the buoyancy associated with density difference and cannot be replaced by full gravitational acceleration. Combined with depth under a square root, it produces a characteristic velocity comparable with withdrawal speed. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Stratification and withdrawal inertia” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：g=9.81 m/s2; drho=2 kg/m3; rho=1000 kg/m3; h=8 m; v=0.2 m/s; Fr=v/sqrt(g drho h/rho)=0.50482。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: g=9.81 m/s2; drho=2 kg/m3; rho=1000 kg/m3; h=8 m; v=0.2 m/s; Fr=v/sqrt(g drho h/rho)=0.50482.","failure":"常見誤解：「密度福祿數有適用所有取水口的固定允許值」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Densimetric Froude number has one fixed permitted value for all intakes\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「密度分層與取水慣性」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Stratification and withdrawal inertia”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-21-k1","title":"密度分層與取水慣性","titleEn":"Stratification and withdrawal inertia","text":"水庫冷暖水層的密度差提供恢復浮力，取水流速則會拉動界面。以約化重力及密度福祿數比較慣性與浮力，可討論選擇性取水是否容易擾動水層，但實際取水形狀、界面厚度與三維流場仍不可省略。","textEn":"Density contrast between warm and cool layers supplies restoring buoyancy while withdrawal velocity disturbs the interface. Reduced gravity and a densimetric Froude number compare inertia with buoyancy, without resolving intake geometry, interface thickness or the three-dimensional withdrawal field.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：密度福祿數有適用所有取水口的固定允許值 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Densimetric Froude number has one fixed permitted value for all intakes Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「密度分層與取水慣性」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Stratification and withdrawal inertia\" is correct?","options":["水庫冷暖水層的密度差提供恢復浮力，取水流速則會拉動界面。","密度福祿數有適用所有取水口的固定允許值","只知道水位增量就能判斷剩餘蓄洪空間"],"optionsEn":["Density contrast between warm and cool layers supplies restoring buoyancy while withdrawal velocity disturbs the interface.","Densimetric Froude number has one fixed permitted value for all intakes","Knowing only level increment establishes remaining flood-storage capacity"],"answer":0,"explanation":"水庫冷暖水層的密度差提供恢復浮力，取水流速則會拉動界面。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Density contrast between warm and cool layers supplies restoring buoyancy while withdrawal velocity disturbs the interface. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b216-v15-22","title":"密度分層與取水慣性：定量估算","titleEn":"Stratification and withdrawal inertia: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「密度分層與取水慣性」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Stratification and withdrawal inertia” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：g=9.81 m/s2; drho=2 kg/m3; rho=1000 kg/m3; h=8 m; v=0.2 m/s; Fr=v/sqrt(g drho h/rho)=0.50482。適用邊界：兩層近似、密度差小且水深為假想作用尺度，非設備臨界值。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: g=9.81 m/s2; drho=2 kg/m3; rho=1000 kg/m3; h=8 m; v=0.2 m/s; Fr=v/sqrt(g drho h/rho)=0.50482. Applicable boundary: A small-density-difference two-layer approximation with hypothetical depth scale, not an equipment threshold. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：沿深度量測溫度與密度，確認界面存在並記錄測點時間，再用流量與有效進水面積估算局部速度。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure depth profiles of temperature and density to establish an interface and record sampling times.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：g=9.81 m/s2; drho=2 kg/m3; rho=1000 kg/m3; h=8 m; v=0.2 m/s; Fr=v/sqrt(g drho h/rho)=0.50482。適用邊界：兩層近似、密度差小且水深為假想作用尺度，非設備臨界值。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: g=9.81 m/s2; drho=2 kg/m3; rho=1000 kg/m3; h=8 m; v=0.2 m/s; Fr=v/sqrt(g drho h/rho)=0.50482. Applicable boundary: A small-density-difference two-layer approximation with hypothetical depth scale, not an equipment threshold.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「密度分層與取水慣性」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Stratification and withdrawal inertia\", which statement holds?","options":["濁度數值可以直接當作每立方公尺固體公斤數","原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：g=9.81 m/s2; drho=2 kg/m3; rho=1000 kg/m3; h=8 m; v=0.2 m/s; Fr=v/sqrt(g drho h/rho)=0.50482。","名目停留時間就是每滴水完全相同的水齡"],"optionsEn":["A turbidity value directly equals kilograms of solids per cubic metre","Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: g=9.81 m/s2.","Nominal residence time is the identical age of every water parcel"],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：g=9.81 m/s2; drho=2 kg/m3; rho=1000 kg/m3; h=8 m; v=0.2 m/s; Fr=v/sqrt(g drho h/rho)=0.50482。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: g=9.81 m/s2; drho=2 kg/m3; rho=1000 kg/m3; h=8 m; v=0.2 m/s; Fr=v/sqrt(g drho h/rho)=0.50482. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b216-v15-23","title":"密度分層與取水慣性：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Stratification and withdrawal inertia: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「密度分層與取水慣性」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Stratification and withdrawal inertia” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"沿深度量測溫度與密度，確認界面存在並記錄測點時間，再用流量與有效進水面積估算局部速度。比較不同取水時段的剖面變化，留意風混合也可能造成界面移動而非全部由取水引起。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure depth profiles of temperature and density to establish an interface and record sampling times. Estimate local velocity from flow and effective intake area, then compare profiles across withdrawal periods while accounting for wind-driven mixing as an alternative cause. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將密度差減半而保持速度不變，重算無因次數並描述浮力恢復變弱的意義，再列出需用水槽或數值模型確認的取水口幾何效應。","observationEn":"Site practice: Halve the density difference at unchanged velocity, recalculate the dimensionless number and explain weaker buoyant restoration. Identify intake-geometry effects requiring physical experiments or a resolved flow model.","failure":"注意干擾：把全庫平均流速代替取水口附近速度可能嚴重低估慣性；直接把無因次數當成固定允許值，也會忽略幾何、分層厚度與入流條件，使比較失去物理依據。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Reservoir-wide mean velocity can greatly understate inertia near an intake. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"沿深度量測溫度與密度，確認界面存在並記錄測點時間，再用流量與有效進水面積估算局部速度。比較不同取水時段的剖面變化，留意風混合也可能造成界面移動而非全部由取水引起。","textEn":"Measure depth profiles of temperature and density to establish an interface and record sampling times. Estimate local velocity from flow and effective intake area, then compare profiles across withdrawal periods while accounting for wind-driven mixing as an alternative cause.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將密度差減半而保持速度不變，重算無因次數並描述浮力恢復變弱的意義，再列出需用水槽或數值模型確認的取水口幾何效應。","textEn":"Halve the density difference at unchanged velocity, recalculate the dimensionless number and explain weaker buoyant restoration. Identify intake-geometry effects requiring physical experiments or a resolved flow model.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「密度分層與取水慣性」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Stratification and withdrawal inertia\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","一條力路變軟不會改變另一條力路的分力","沿深度量測溫度與密度，確認界面存在並記錄測點時間，再用流量與有效進水面積估算局部速度。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Softening one load path leaves force in the other path unchanged","Measure depth profiles of temperature and density to establish an interface and record sampling times."],"answer":2,"explanation":"沿深度量測溫度與密度，確認界面存在並記錄測點時間，再用流量與有效進水面積估算局部速度。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure depth profiles of temperature and density to establish an interface and record sampling times. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b216-v15-24","title":"密度分層與取水慣性：失效診斷","titleEn":"Stratification and withdrawal inertia: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「密度分層與取水慣性」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Stratification and withdrawal inertia” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把全庫平均流速代替取水口附近速度可能嚴重低估慣性；直接把無因次數當成固定允許值，也會忽略幾何、分層厚度與入流條件，使比較失去物理依據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Reservoir-wide mean velocity can greatly understate inertia near an intake. Treating the dimensionless number as a universal permitted value ignores geometry, interface thickness and inflow conditions that control its interpretation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：約化重力只保留密度差造成的浮力尺度，不能用完整重力取代；其平方根與水深共同形成可與流速比較的特徵速度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Combined with depth under a square root, it produces a characteristic velocity comparable with withdrawal speed.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「密度福祿數有適用所有取水口的固定允許值」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Densimetric Froude number has one fixed permitted value for all intakes\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把全庫平均流速代替取水口附近速度可能嚴重低估慣性；直接把無因次數當成固定允許值，也會忽略幾何、分層厚度與入流條件，使比較失去物理依據。","textEn":"Reservoir-wide mean velocity can greatly understate inertia near an intake. Treating the dimensionless number as a universal permitted value ignores geometry, interface thickness and inflow conditions that control its interpretation.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「密度分層與取水慣性」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Stratification and withdrawal inertia\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["把全庫平均流速代替取水口附近速度可能嚴重低估慣性；直接把無因次數當成固定允許值，也會忽略幾何、分層厚度與入流條件，使比較失去物理依據。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","只知道水位增量就能判斷剩餘蓄洪空間"],"optionsEn":["Reservoir-wide mean velocity can greatly understate inertia near an intake.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","Knowing only level increment establishes remaining flood-storage capacity"],"answer":0,"explanation":"把全庫平均流速代替取水口附近速度可能嚴重低估慣性；直接把無因次數當成固定允許值，也會忽略幾何、分層厚度與入流條件，使比較失去物理依據。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Reservoir-wide mean velocity can greatly understate inertia near an intake. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b216-v15-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「颱風入流與短時水位」與「水躍共軛水深」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Storm inflow and short term level\" and \"Hydraulic jump conjugate depths\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b216-v15-25","title":"颱風入流與短時水位：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Storm inflow and short term level: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-24"],"objective":"說明「颱風入流與短時水位」如何影響翡翠水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Storm inflow and short term level” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Feitsui Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"颱風期間水量累積取決於入流減放流的時程，水面積把蓄量差轉成水位差。以局部固定面積作近似可快速估計量級，但翡翠的真實地形曲線與隨水位變動的出口能力會使線性估算偏離實況。 局部面積就是庫容對水位的導數，因此固定面積近似只適合變動不大的一段高程；跨越地形突變時應分段處理。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「颱風入流與短時水位」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"During a storm, storage accumulates from the time history of inflow minus release. Local water area converts volume change into level change as a first approximation, while real geometry and level-dependent outlet behavior can depart from that linear estimate. Local surface area is the derivative of storage with respect to elevation. Constant area is therefore a local approximation, and a level change spanning abrupt topographic variation should be integrated in segments. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Storm inflow and short term level” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Qnet=140 m3/s; dt=10800 s; A=8000000 m2; dH=Qnet dt/A=0.189 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Qnet=140 m3/s; dt=10800 s; A=8000000 m2; dH=Qnet dt/A=0.189 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「只知道水位增量就能判斷剩餘蓄洪空間」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Knowing only level increment establishes remaining flood-storage capacity\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「颱風入流與短時水位」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Storm inflow and short term level”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-25-k1","title":"颱風入流與短時水位","titleEn":"Storm inflow and short term level","text":"颱風期間水量累積取決於入流減放流的時程，水面積把蓄量差轉成水位差。以局部固定面積作近似可快速估計量級，但翡翠的真實地形曲線與隨水位變動的出口能力會使線性估算偏離實況。","textEn":"During a storm, storage accumulates from the time history of inflow minus release. Local water area converts volume change into level change as a first approximation, while real geometry and level-dependent outlet behavior can depart from that linear estimate.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只知道水位增量就能判斷剩餘蓄洪空間 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Knowing only level increment establishes remaining flood-storage capacity Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「颱風入流與短時水位」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Storm inflow and short term level\" is correct?","options":["只知道水位增量就能判斷剩餘蓄洪空間","颱風期間水量累積取決於入流減放流的時程，水面積把蓄量差轉成水位差。","水躍同時保持動量函數與機械比能不變"],"optionsEn":["Knowing only level increment establishes remaining flood-storage capacity","During a storm, storage accumulates from the time history of inflow minus release.","A hydraulic jump conserves both momentum function and mechanical specific energy"],"answer":1,"explanation":"颱風期間水量累積取決於入流減放流的時程，水面積把蓄量差轉成水位差。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"During a storm, storage accumulates from the time history of inflow minus release. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b216-v15-26","title":"颱風入流與短時水位：定量估算","titleEn":"Storm inflow and short term level: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「颱風入流與短時水位」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Storm inflow and short term level” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Qnet=140 m3/s; dt=10800 s; A=8000000 m2; dH=Qnet dt/A=0.189 m。適用邊界：三小時淨入流與水面積固定，沒有指定實際蓄洪空間或放流規則。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Qnet=140 m3/s; dt=10800 s; A=8000000 m2; dH=Qnet dt/A=0.189 m. Applicable boundary: Constant net inflow and surface area for three hours, without specifying real flood space or release rules. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用逐時入出流積分先求體積，再以相鄰高程面積曲線求水位並比較固定面積結果。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Integrate hourly inlet and outlet flows for volume, then use neighboring elevation-area data to estimate level and compare with the fixed-area result.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Qnet=140 m3/s; dt=10800 s; A=8000000 m2; dH=Qnet dt/A=0.189 m。適用邊界：三小時淨入流與水面積固定，沒有指定實際蓄洪空間或放流規則。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Qnet=140 m3/s; dt=10800 s; A=8000000 m2; dH=Qnet dt/A=0.189 m. Applicable boundary: Constant net inflow and surface area for three hours, without specifying real flood space or release rules.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「颱風入流與短時水位」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Storm inflow and short term level\", which statement holds?","options":["兩股流量不同時仍可把濃度直接取算術平均","曲面水平水推力可直接用底壓乘全部曲面面積","原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Qnet=140 m3/s; dt=10800 s; A=8000000 m2; dH=Qnet dt/A=0.189 m。"],"optionsEn":["Two concentrations can be averaged arithmetically even when source flows differ","Horizontal hydrostatic force equals bottom pressure times the entire curved area","Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Qnet=140 m3/s; dt=10800 s; A=8000000 m2; dH=Qnet dt/A=0.189 m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Qnet=140 m3/s; dt=10800 s; A=8000000 m2; dH=Qnet dt/A=0.189 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Qnet=140 m3/s; dt=10800 s; A=8000000 m2; dH=Qnet dt/A=0.189 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b216-v15-27","title":"颱風入流與短時水位：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Storm inflow and short term level: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「颱風入流與短時水位」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Storm inflow and short term level” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用逐時入出流積分先求體積，再以相鄰高程面積曲線求水位並比較固定面積結果。保留初始水位及面積資料年代，查明降雨、側流和量測時間差是否已納入水量平衡。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Integrate hourly inlet and outlet flows for volume, then use neighboring elevation-area data to estimate level and compare with the fixed-area result. Retain initial level and survey date, checking rainfall, lateral inflow and measurement timing in the balance. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：把水面積改成隨水位增加的兩段值，分段解同一體積的水位增量，再比較固定面積近似的高估或低估方向，註明地形曲線的不確定性。","observationEn":"Site practice: Use two surface-area segments that increase with elevation, solve the level change for the same volume and determine whether constant area overestimates or underestimates it, retaining uncertainty in the geometry curve.","failure":"注意干擾：只用暴雨峰值流量乘整場歷時會放大蓄量；反之以日平均淹沒短時洪峰，可能低估最大水位。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Multiplying a storm peak by the whole event overstates volume, while daily averaging can suppress the maximum level. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用逐時入出流積分先求體積，再以相鄰高程面積曲線求水位並比較固定面積結果。保留初始水位及面積資料年代，查明降雨、側流和量測時間差是否已納入水量平衡。","textEn":"Integrate hourly inlet and outlet flows for volume, then use neighboring elevation-area data to estimate level and compare with the fixed-area result. Retain initial level and survey date, checking rainfall, lateral inflow and measurement timing in the balance.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"把水面積改成隨水位增加的兩段值，分段解同一體積的水位增量，再比較固定面積近似的高估或低估方向，註明地形曲線的不確定性。","textEn":"Use two surface-area segments that increase with elevation, solve the level change for the same volume and determine whether constant area overestimates or underestimates it, retaining uncertainty in the geometry curve.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「颱風入流與短時水位」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Storm inflow and short term level\"?","options":["用逐時入出流積分先求體積，再以相鄰高程面積曲線求水位並比較固定面積結果。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","不必扣除孔隙水壓即可用總正向力算摩擦"],"optionsEn":["Integrate hourly inlet and outlet flows for volume, then use neighboring elevation-area data to estimate level and compare with the fixed-area result.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Friction can use total normal force without deducting pore pressure"],"answer":0,"explanation":"用逐時入出流積分先求體積，再以相鄰高程面積曲線求水位並比較固定面積結果。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Integrate hourly inlet and outlet flows for volume, then use neighboring elevation-area data to estimate level and compare with the fixed-area result. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b216-v15-28","title":"颱風入流與短時水位：失效診斷","titleEn":"Storm inflow and short term level: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「颱風入流與短時水位」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Storm inflow and short term level” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只用暴雨峰值流量乘整場歷時會放大蓄量；反之以日平均淹沒短時洪峰，可能低估最大水位。沒有初始水位的增加量無法判斷剩餘空間是否足夠。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Multiplying a storm peak by the whole event overstates volume, while daily averaging can suppress the maximum level. A level increment without the initial elevation cannot establish how much storage space remains. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：局部面積就是庫容對水位的導數，因此固定面積近似只適合變動不大的一段高程；跨越地形突變時應分段處理。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Constant area is therefore a local approximation, and a level change spanning abrupt topographic variation should be integrated in segments.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只知道水位增量就能判斷剩餘蓄洪空間」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Knowing only level increment establishes remaining flood-storage capacity\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只用暴雨峰值流量乘整場歷時會放大蓄量；反之以日平均淹沒短時洪峰，可能低估最大水位。沒有初始水位的增加量無法判斷剩餘空間是否足夠。","textEn":"Multiplying a storm peak by the whole event overstates volume, while daily averaging can suppress the maximum level. A level increment without the initial elevation cannot establish how much storage space remains.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「颱風入流與短時水位」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Storm inflow and short term level\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","只用暴雨峰值流量乘整場歷時會放大蓄量；反之以日平均淹沒短時洪峰，可能低估最大水位。","水躍同時保持動量函數與機械比能不變"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Multiplying a storm peak by the whole event overstates volume, while daily averaging can suppress the maximum level.","A hydraulic jump conserves both momentum function and mechanical specific energy"],"answer":1,"explanation":"只用暴雨峰值流量乘整場歷時會放大蓄量；反之以日平均淹沒短時洪峰，可能低估最大水位。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Multiplying a storm peak by the whole event overstates volume, while daily averaging can suppress the maximum level. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b216-v15-29","title":"水躍共軛水深：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Hydraulic jump conjugate depths: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-28"],"objective":"說明「水躍共軛水深」如何影響翡翠水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Hydraulic jump conjugate depths” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Feitsui Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"溢流後的高速淺水若轉成低速深水，可透過水躍耗散能量。矩形渠道的動量平衡給出上下游共軛水深，這不代表任意尾水都能穩住水躍；實際消能池還受床面、空氣摻混及側向流動影響。 躍前與躍後流量相同但速度與水深改變，動量函數相等不代表比能相等，兩斷面的比能差才是耗散的量。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「水躍共軛水深」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A hydraulic jump converts fast shallow flow into slower deeper flow while dissipating energy. Rectangular-channel momentum gives conjugate depths, but arbitrary tailwater will not necessarily hold the jump in place, and actual basins involve aeration, bed details and lateral effects. Discharge is conserved across the jump while depth and velocity change. Equal momentum functions do not imply equal specific energies; their specific-energy difference quantifies the mechanical energy dissipated in the transition. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Hydraulic jump conjugate depths” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：y1=1 m; v1=8 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; Fr1=v1/sqrt(g y1); y2=y1(sqrt(1+8Fr1^2)-1)/2=3.14663 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: y1=1 m; v1=8 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; Fr1=v1/sqrt(g y1); y2=y1(sqrt(1+8Fr1^2)-1)/2=3.14663 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「水躍同時保持動量函數與機械比能不變」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A hydraulic jump conserves both momentum function and mechanical specific energy\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「水躍共軛水深」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Hydraulic jump conjugate depths”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-29-k1","title":"水躍共軛水深","titleEn":"Hydraulic jump conjugate depths","text":"溢流後的高速淺水若轉成低速深水，可透過水躍耗散能量。矩形渠道的動量平衡給出上下游共軛水深，這不代表任意尾水都能穩住水躍；實際消能池還受床面、空氣摻混及側向流動影響。","textEn":"A hydraulic jump converts fast shallow flow into slower deeper flow while dissipating energy. Rectangular-channel momentum gives conjugate depths, but arbitrary tailwater will not necessarily hold the jump in place, and actual basins involve aeration, bed details and lateral effects.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：水躍同時保持動量函數與機械比能不變 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A hydraulic jump conserves both momentum function and mechanical specific energy Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「水躍共軛水深」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Hydraulic jump conjugate depths\" is correct?","options":["水躍同時保持動量函數與機械比能不變","濁度數值可以直接當作每立方公尺固體公斤數","溢流後的高速淺水若轉成低速深水，可透過水躍耗散能量。"],"optionsEn":["A hydraulic jump conserves both momentum function and mechanical specific energy","A turbidity value directly equals kilograms of solids per cubic metre","A hydraulic jump converts fast shallow flow into slower deeper flow while dissipating energy."],"answer":2,"explanation":"溢流後的高速淺水若轉成低速深水，可透過水躍耗散能量。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A hydraulic jump converts fast shallow flow into slower deeper flow while dissipating energy. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b216-v15-30","title":"水躍共軛水深：定量估算","titleEn":"Hydraulic jump conjugate depths: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「水躍共軛水深」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Hydraulic jump conjugate depths” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：y1=1 m; v1=8 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; Fr1=v1/sqrt(g y1); y2=y1(sqrt(1+8Fr1^2)-1)/2=3.14663 m。適用邊界：水平矩形渠道、靜水壓斷面與一維動量；未提供真實消能池尺寸。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: y1=1 m; v1=8 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; Fr1=v1/sqrt(g y1); y2=y1(sqrt(1+8Fr1^2)-1)/2=3.14663 m. Applicable boundary: Horizontal rectangular channel, hydrostatic sections and one-dimensional momentum, without sizing an actual basin. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：先用連續方程求下游平均速度，再核對兩斷面的動量函數接近相等，最後比較比能以確認能量下降。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Use continuity to recover downstream velocity, check equality of momentum functions and compare specific energy to confirm dissipation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：y1=1 m; v1=8 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; Fr1=v1/sqrt(g y1); y2=y1(sqrt(1+8Fr1^2)-1)/2=3.14663 m。適用邊界：水平矩形渠道、靜水壓斷面與一維動量；未提供真實消能池尺寸。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: y1=1 m; v1=8 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; Fr1=v1/sqrt(g y1); y2=y1(sqrt(1+8Fr1^2)-1)/2=3.14663 m. Applicable boundary: Horizontal rectangular channel, hydrostatic sections and one-dimensional momentum, without sizing an actual basin.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「水躍共軛水深」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Hydraulic jump conjugate depths\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：y1=1 m; v1=8 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; Fr1=v1/sqrt(g y1); y2=y1(sqrt(1+8Fr1^2)-1)/2=3.14663 m。","名目停留時間就是每滴水完全相同的水齡","一條力路變軟不會改變另一條力路的分力"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: y1=1 m.","Nominal residence time is the identical age of every water parcel","Softening one load path leaves force in the other path unchanged"],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：y1=1 m; v1=8 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; Fr1=v1/sqrt(g y1); y2=y1(sqrt(1+8Fr1^2)-1)/2=3.14663 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: y1=1 m; v1=8 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; Fr1=v1/sqrt(g y1); y2=y1(sqrt(1+8Fr1^2)-1)/2=3.14663 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b216-v15-31","title":"水躍共軛水深：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Hydraulic jump conjugate depths: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「水躍共軛水深」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Hydraulic jump conjugate depths” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"先用連續方程求下游平均速度，再核對兩斷面的動量函數接近相等，最後比較比能以確認能量下降。水槽觀察應記錄水躍位置與尾水變化，不能只量一張照片中的水深。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Use continuity to recover downstream velocity, check equality of momentum functions and compare specific energy to confirm dissipation. In a flume, record jump location as tailwater changes rather than relying on depths captured in a single photograph. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將入口速度改為六公尺每秒，重新求共軛水深和出口速度，說明為何水躍高度改變，並列出需要尾水曲線才能判斷的定位問題。","observationEn":"Site practice: Reduce inlet velocity to six metres per second, recalculate conjugate depth and downstream velocity, and explain the height change. Identify jump-location questions that require a tailwater relationship.","failure":"注意干擾：把共軛水深當成保證穩定水躍的尾水設定，可能忽略掃出或淹沒；若又把耗能量當作局部壓力，將無法辨識床面脈動、氣蝕與沖刷的不同機制。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A conjugate depth does not guarantee a stable jump; sweep-out or submergence may occur. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"先用連續方程求下游平均速度，再核對兩斷面的動量函數接近相等，最後比較比能以確認能量下降。水槽觀察應記錄水躍位置與尾水變化，不能只量一張照片中的水深。","textEn":"Use continuity to recover downstream velocity, check equality of momentum functions and compare specific energy to confirm dissipation. In a flume, record jump location as tailwater changes rather than relying on depths captured in a single photograph.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將入口速度改為六公尺每秒，重新求共軛水深和出口速度，說明為何水躍高度改變，並列出需要尾水曲線才能判斷的定位問題。","textEn":"Reduce inlet velocity to six metres per second, recalculate conjugate depth and downstream velocity, and explain the height change. Identify jump-location questions that require a tailwater relationship.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「水躍共軛水深」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Hydraulic jump conjugate depths\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","先用連續方程求下游平均速度，再核對兩斷面的動量函數接近相等，最後比較比能以確認能量下降。","單塊自由伸長必然等於接縫實際開口增量"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Use continuity to recover downstream velocity, check equality of momentum functions and compare specific energy to confirm dissipation.","Free expansion of one block necessarily equals actual joint opening"],"answer":1,"explanation":"先用連續方程求下游平均速度，再核對兩斷面的動量函數接近相等，最後比較比能以確認能量下降。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Use continuity to recover downstream velocity, check equality of momentum functions and compare specific energy to confirm dissipation. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b216-v15-32","title":"水躍共軛水深：失效診斷","titleEn":"Hydraulic jump conjugate depths: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「水躍共軛水深」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Hydraulic jump conjugate depths” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把共軛水深當成保證穩定水躍的尾水設定，可能忽略掃出或淹沒；若又把耗能量當作局部壓力，將無法辨識床面脈動、氣蝕與沖刷的不同機制。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A conjugate depth does not guarantee a stable jump; sweep-out or submergence may occur. Treating dissipated energy as local pressure also obscures distinct mechanisms of fluctuating loads, cavitation and scour. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：躍前與躍後流量相同但速度與水深改變，動量函數相等不代表比能相等，兩斷面的比能差才是耗散的量。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Equal momentum functions do not imply equal specific energies; their specific-energy difference quantifies the mechanical energy dissipated in the transition.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「水躍同時保持動量函數與機械比能不變」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A hydraulic jump conserves both momentum function and mechanical specific energy\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把共軛水深當成保證穩定水躍的尾水設定，可能忽略掃出或淹沒；若又把耗能量當作局部壓力，將無法辨識床面脈動、氣蝕與沖刷的不同機制。","textEn":"A conjugate depth does not guarantee a stable jump; sweep-out or submergence may occur. Treating dissipated energy as local pressure also obscures distinct mechanisms of fluctuating loads, cavitation and scour.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「水躍共軛水深」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Hydraulic jump conjugate depths\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","濁度數值可以直接當作每立方公尺固體公斤數","把共軛水深當成保證穩定水躍的尾水設定，可能忽略掃出或淹沒；若又把耗能量當作局部壓力，將無法辨識床面脈動、氣蝕與沖刷的不同機制。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","A turbidity value directly equals kilograms of solids per cubic metre","A conjugate depth does not guarantee a stable jump; sweep-out or submergence may occur."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把共軛水深當成保證穩定水躍的尾水設定，可能忽略掃出或淹沒；若又把耗能量當作局部壓力，將無法辨識床面脈動、氣蝕與沖刷的不同機制。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A conjugate depth does not guarantee a stable jump; sweep-out or submergence may occur. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b216-v15-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「含砂濃度與固體負荷」與「原水保守溶質混合」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Sediment concentration and mass load\" and \"Conservative raw water mixing\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b216-v15-33","title":"含砂濃度與固體負荷：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Sediment concentration and mass load: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-32"],"objective":"說明「含砂濃度與固體負荷」如何影響翡翠水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Sediment concentration and mass load” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Feitsui Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"流量與懸浮固體質量濃度相乘得到輸入固體的質量率，可把集水區侵蝕與水庫占容問題串連。濁度是光學反應而非質量濃度，翡翠背景的教學不能不經現地校準就把濁度單位直接乘流量。 質量率積分得到的是運輸量，轉成沉積體積還要知道留下比例與乾容重，因而輸砂與庫容測量應分開設計。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「含砂濃度與固體負荷」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Discharge times suspended-solids mass concentration gives a solids delivery rate linking catchment erosion to reservoir storage. Turbidity is an optical response rather than mass concentration, so it cannot be multiplied directly by flow without a site-specific conversion and its uncertainty. Integrating mass flux gives transported solids. Conversion to deposited volume additionally requires retention and dry bulk density, so sediment transport measurements and reservoir-capacity surveys address related but distinct quantities. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Sediment concentration and mass load” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Q=12 m3/s; C=0.35 kg/m3; dt=7200 s; M=Q C dt=30240 kg。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q=12 m3/s; C=0.35 kg/m3; dt=7200 s; M=Q C dt=30240 kg.","failure":"常見誤解：「濁度數值可以直接當作每立方公尺固體公斤數」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A turbidity value directly equals kilograms of solids per cubic metre\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「含砂濃度與固體負荷」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Sediment concentration and mass load”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-33-k1","title":"含砂濃度與固體負荷","titleEn":"Sediment concentration and mass load","text":"流量與懸浮固體質量濃度相乘得到輸入固體的質量率，可把集水區侵蝕與水庫占容問題串連。濁度是光學反應而非質量濃度，翡翠背景的教學不能不經現地校準就把濁度單位直接乘流量。","textEn":"Discharge times suspended-solids mass concentration gives a solids delivery rate linking catchment erosion to reservoir storage. Turbidity is an optical response rather than mass concentration, so it cannot be multiplied directly by flow without a site-specific conversion and its uncertainty.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：濁度數值可以直接當作每立方公尺固體公斤數 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A turbidity value directly equals kilograms of solids per cubic metre Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「含砂濃度與固體負荷」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Sediment concentration and mass load\" is correct?","options":["流量與懸浮固體質量濃度相乘得到輸入固體的質量率，可把集水區侵蝕與水庫占容問題串連。","濁度數值可以直接當作每立方公尺固體公斤數","兩股流量不同時仍可把濃度直接取算術平均"],"optionsEn":["Discharge times suspended-solids mass concentration gives a solids delivery rate linking catchment erosion to reservoir storage.","A turbidity value directly equals kilograms of solids per cubic metre","Two concentrations can be averaged arithmetically even when source flows differ"],"answer":0,"explanation":"流量與懸浮固體質量濃度相乘得到輸入固體的質量率，可把集水區侵蝕與水庫占容問題串連。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Discharge times suspended-solids mass concentration gives a solids delivery rate linking catchment erosion to reservoir storage. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b216-v15-34","title":"含砂濃度與固體負荷：定量估算","titleEn":"Sediment concentration and mass load: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「含砂濃度與固體負荷」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Sediment concentration and mass load” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Q=12 m3/s; C=0.35 kg/m3; dt=7200 s; M=Q C dt=30240 kg。適用邊界：兩小時代表濃度與流量固定，僅懸浮輸砂，不含推移質與庫內沉降。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q=12 m3/s; C=0.35 kg/m3; dt=7200 s; M=Q C dt=30240 kg. Applicable boundary: Constant representative concentration and flow for two hours; suspended load only, excluding bed load and reservoir deposition. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：同時採集斷面流量與混合代表水樣，以過濾乾燥法取得質量濃度，再用濁度建立有誤差範圍的輔助關係。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Pair cross-section discharge with representative composite samples, determine mass concentration by filtration and drying, and use turbidity only through an uncertain calibration.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Q=12 m3/s; C=0.35 kg/m3; dt=7200 s; M=Q C dt=30240 kg。適用邊界：兩小時代表濃度與流量固定，僅懸浮輸砂，不含推移質與庫內沉降。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q=12 m3/s; C=0.35 kg/m3; dt=7200 s; M=Q C dt=30240 kg. Applicable boundary: Constant representative concentration and flow for two hours; suspended load only, excluding bed load and reservoir deposition.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「含砂濃度與固體負荷」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Sediment concentration and mass load\", which statement holds?","options":["曲面水平水推力可直接用底壓乘全部曲面面積","原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Q=12 m3/s; C=0.35 kg/m3; dt=7200 s; M=Q C dt=30240 kg。","不必扣除孔隙水壓即可用總正向力算摩擦"],"optionsEn":["Horizontal hydrostatic force equals bottom pressure times the entire curved area","Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q=12 m3/s; C=0.35 kg/m3; dt=7200 s; M=Q C dt=30240 kg.","Friction can use total normal force without deducting pore pressure"],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Q=12 m3/s; C=0.35 kg/m3; dt=7200 s; M=Q C dt=30240 kg。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q=12 m3/s; C=0.35 kg/m3; dt=7200 s; M=Q C dt=30240 kg. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b216-v15-35","title":"含砂濃度與固體負荷：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Sediment concentration and mass load: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「含砂濃度與固體負荷」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Sediment concentration and mass load” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"同時採集斷面流量與混合代表水樣，以過濾乾燥法取得質量濃度，再用濁度建立有誤差範圍的輔助關係。檢查洪峰前後是否有遲滯，避免只採清水期而漏掉主要固體負荷。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Pair cross-section discharge with representative composite samples, determine mass concentration by filtration and drying, and use turbidity only through an uncertain calibration. Check rising and falling limbs for hysteresis so clear-water sampling does not miss the dominant solids load. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：假設濃度在第一小時加倍而第二小時減半，分段求質量並比較原值，再說明若流量同步變動，使用兩個平均值相乘會有何偏差。","observationEn":"Site practice: Double concentration in the first hour and halve it in the second, integrate mass and compare with the original case. Explain the bias from multiplying separate averages when discharge varies simultaneously.","failure":"注意干擾：以單一岸邊樣本代表全斷面會漏掉垂向與橫向濃度梯度；把輸入固體全當作永久沉積，也會忽略排出、再懸浮與密度壓密，使庫容損失估算偏離。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: One bank sample may miss vertical and lateral gradients. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同時採集斷面流量與混合代表水樣，以過濾乾燥法取得質量濃度，再用濁度建立有誤差範圍的輔助關係。檢查洪峰前後是否有遲滯，避免只採清水期而漏掉主要固體負荷。","textEn":"Pair cross-section discharge with representative composite samples, determine mass concentration by filtration and drying, and use turbidity only through an uncertain calibration. Check rising and falling limbs for hysteresis so clear-water sampling does not miss the dominant solids load.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"假設濃度在第一小時加倍而第二小時減半，分段求質量並比較原值，再說明若流量同步變動，使用兩個平均值相乘會有何偏差。","textEn":"Double concentration in the first hour and halve it in the second, integrate mass and compare with the original case. Explain the bias from multiplying separate averages when discharge varies simultaneously.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「含砂濃度與固體負荷」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Sediment concentration and mass load\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","密度福祿數有適用所有取水口的固定允許值","同時採集斷面流量與混合代表水樣，以過濾乾燥法取得質量濃度，再用濁度建立有誤差範圍的輔助關係。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Densimetric Froude number has one fixed permitted value for all intakes","Pair cross-section discharge with representative composite samples, determine mass concentration by filtration and drying, and use turbidity only through an uncertain calibration."],"answer":2,"explanation":"同時採集斷面流量與混合代表水樣，以過濾乾燥法取得質量濃度，再用濁度建立有誤差範圍的輔助關係。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Pair cross-section discharge with representative composite samples, determine mass concentration by filtration and drying, and use turbidity only through an uncertain calibration. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b216-v15-36","title":"含砂濃度與固體負荷：失效診斷","titleEn":"Sediment concentration and mass load: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「含砂濃度與固體負荷」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Sediment concentration and mass load” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"以單一岸邊樣本代表全斷面會漏掉垂向與橫向濃度梯度；把輸入固體全當作永久沉積，也會忽略排出、再懸浮與密度壓密，使庫容損失估算偏離。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"One bank sample may miss vertical and lateral gradients. Treating all incoming solids as permanent deposition ignores passage, resuspension and compaction, so transported mass cannot directly establish lost reservoir volume. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：質量率積分得到的是運輸量，轉成沉積體積還要知道留下比例與乾容重，因而輸砂與庫容測量應分開設計。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Conversion to deposited volume additionally requires retention and dry bulk density, so sediment transport measurements and reservoir-capacity surveys address related but distinct quantities.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「濁度數值可以直接當作每立方公尺固體公斤數」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A turbidity value directly equals kilograms of solids per cubic metre\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"以單一岸邊樣本代表全斷面會漏掉垂向與橫向濃度梯度；把輸入固體全當作永久沉積，也會忽略排出、再懸浮與密度壓密，使庫容損失估算偏離。","textEn":"One bank sample may miss vertical and lateral gradients. Treating all incoming solids as permanent deposition ignores passage, resuspension and compaction, so transported mass cannot directly establish lost reservoir volume.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「含砂濃度與固體負荷」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Sediment concentration and mass load\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["以單一岸邊樣本代表全斷面會漏掉垂向與橫向濃度梯度；把輸入固體全當作永久沉積，也會忽略排出、再懸浮與密度壓密，使庫容損失估算偏離。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","兩股流量不同時仍可把濃度直接取算術平均"],"optionsEn":["One bank sample may miss vertical and lateral gradients.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Two concentrations can be averaged arithmetically even when source flows differ"],"answer":0,"explanation":"以單一岸邊樣本代表全斷面會漏掉垂向與橫向濃度梯度；把輸入固體全當作永久沉積，也會忽略排出、再懸浮與密度壓密，使庫容損失估算偏離。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"One bank sample may miss vertical and lateral gradients. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b216-v15-37","title":"原水保守溶質混合：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Conservative raw water mixing: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-36"],"objective":"說明「原水保守溶質混合」如何影響翡翠水庫大壩的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Conservative raw water mixing” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Feitsui Dam”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"不同深度原水混合後，保守溶質濃度由流量加權質量守恆求得。這個概念能教導取水來源比例的重要性，但濁度、藻類與會反應的物質不一定線性混合，不能把保守示蹤物公式套到所有水質指標。 質量守恆以溶質通量為基礎，濃度本身不能直接相加；每股流量權重的總和必須等於一，混合濃度應介於兩來源之間。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「原水保守溶質混合」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A conservative dissolved constituent mixes according to flow-weighted mass balance, illustrating the importance of source proportions. Turbidity, algae and reactive substances need not mix linearly, so the tracer equation is not a universal relationship for every water-quality indicator. Mass conservation applies to solute flux rather than concentration alone. Flow weights must sum to unity, and a conservative two-source blend should lie between the source concentrations when both flows are positive. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Conservative raw water mixing” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Q1=3 m3/s; C1=20 mg/L; Q2=2 m3/s; C2=50 mg/L; Cm=(Q1C1+Q2C2)/(Q1+Q2)=32 mg/L。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q1=3 m3/s; C1=20 mg/L; Q2=2 m3/s; C2=50 mg/L; Cm=(Q1C1+Q2C2)/(Q1+Q2)=32 mg/L.","failure":"常見誤解：「兩股流量不同時仍可把濃度直接取算術平均」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Two concentrations can be averaged arithmetically even when source flows differ\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「原水保守溶質混合」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Conservative raw water mixing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-37-k1","title":"原水保守溶質混合","titleEn":"Conservative raw water mixing","text":"不同深度原水混合後，保守溶質濃度由流量加權質量守恆求得。這個概念能教導取水來源比例的重要性，但濁度、藻類與會反應的物質不一定線性混合，不能把保守示蹤物公式套到所有水質指標。","textEn":"A conservative dissolved constituent mixes according to flow-weighted mass balance, illustrating the importance of source proportions. Turbidity, algae and reactive substances need not mix linearly, so the tracer equation is not a universal relationship for every water-quality indicator.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：兩股流量不同時仍可把濃度直接取算術平均 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Two concentrations can be averaged arithmetically even when source flows differ Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「原水保守溶質混合」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Conservative raw water mixing\" is correct?","options":["兩股流量不同時仍可把濃度直接取算術平均","不同深度原水混合後，保守溶質濃度由流量加權質量守恆求得。","名目停留時間就是每滴水完全相同的水齡"],"optionsEn":["Two concentrations can be averaged arithmetically even when source flows differ","A conservative dissolved constituent mixes according to flow-weighted mass balance, illustrating the importance of source proportions.","Nominal residence time is the identical age of every water parcel"],"answer":1,"explanation":"不同深度原水混合後，保守溶質濃度由流量加權質量守恆求得。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A conservative dissolved constituent mixes according to flow-weighted mass balance, illustrating the importance of source proportions. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b216-v15-38","title":"原水保守溶質混合：定量估算","titleEn":"Conservative raw water mixing: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「原水保守溶質混合」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Conservative raw water mixing” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Q1=3 m3/s; C1=20 mg/L; Q2=2 m3/s; C2=50 mg/L; Cm=(Q1C1+Q2C2)/(Q1+Q2)=32 mg/L。適用邊界：充分混合、無反應的假想溶質，不表示濁度或飲用水合格限值。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q1=3 m3/s; C1=20 mg/L; Q2=2 m3/s; C2=50 mg/L; Cm=(Q1C1+Q2C2)/(Q1+Q2)=32 mg/L. Applicable boundary: Complete mixing of a hypothetical nonreactive solute, not turbidity or a drinking-water acceptance limit. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以相同時段的兩股來源流量及濃度求輸入質量率，核對混合後取樣位置已有足夠混合距離。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Use simultaneous source flows and concentrations to calculate input mass rate and confirm that the outlet sample follows sufficient mixing distance.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Q1=3 m3/s; C1=20 mg/L; Q2=2 m3/s; C2=50 mg/L; Cm=(Q1C1+Q2C2)/(Q1+Q2)=32 mg/L。適用邊界：充分混合、無反應的假想溶質，不表示濁度或飲用水合格限值。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q1=3 m3/s; C1=20 mg/L; Q2=2 m3/s; C2=50 mg/L; Cm=(Q1C1+Q2C2)/(Q1+Q2)=32 mg/L. Applicable boundary: Complete mixing of a hypothetical nonreactive solute, not turbidity or a drinking-water acceptance limit.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「原水保守溶質混合」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Conservative raw water mixing\", which statement holds?","options":["一條力路變軟不會改變另一條力路的分力","單塊自由伸長必然等於接縫實際開口增量","原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Q1=3 m3/s; C1=20 mg/L; Q2=2 m3/s; C2=50 mg/L; Cm=(Q1C1+Q2C2)/(Q1+Q2)=32 mg/L。"],"optionsEn":["Softening one load path leaves force in the other path unchanged","Free expansion of one block necessarily equals actual joint opening","Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q1=3 m3/s; C1=20 mg/L; Q2=2 m3/s; C2=50 mg/L; Cm=(Q1C1+Q2C2)/(Q1+Q2)=32 mg/L."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設，以下數值不是本工程實測或設備設定：Q1=3 m3/s; C1=20 mg/L; Q2=2 m3/s; C2=50 mg/L; Cm=(Q1C1+Q2C2)/(Q1+Q2)=32 mg/L。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not project measurements or equipment settings: Q1=3 m3/s; C1=20 mg/L; Q2=2 m3/s; C2=50 mg/L; Cm=(Q1C1+Q2C2)/(Q1+Q2)=32 mg/L. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b216-v15-39","title":"原水保守溶質混合：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Conservative raw water mixing: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「原水保守溶質混合」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Conservative raw water mixing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以相同時段的兩股來源流量及濃度求輸入質量率，核對混合後取樣位置已有足夠混合距離。將預測值與出口樣本比較時，先補上停留時間，避免把不同水團的濃度直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Use simultaneous source flows and concentrations to calculate input mass rate and confirm that the outlet sample follows sufficient mixing distance. Account for travel time before comparing predicted and measured concentrations so different water parcels are not subtracted as if simultaneous. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：維持總流量五立方公尺每秒，把較高濃度來源減至一立方公尺每秒，重算混合濃度並畫比例曲線，註明這只是保守溶質的教材。","observationEn":"Site practice: Keep total flow at five cubic metres per second, reduce the higher-concentration source to one and recalculate the blend. Plot concentration against source fraction and label the conservative-solute assumption explicitly.","failure":"注意干擾：拿濁度直接做保守濃度混合可能因顆粒絮凝而失準；若取樣位置尚未混勻，單點量值會偏向某股來源，即使整體質量守恆正確仍看似不符合公式。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Applying conservative mixing to turbidity can fail because particles flocculate. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以相同時段的兩股來源流量及濃度求輸入質量率，核對混合後取樣位置已有足夠混合距離。將預測值與出口樣本比較時，先補上停留時間，避免把不同水團的濃度直接相減。","textEn":"Use simultaneous source flows and concentrations to calculate input mass rate and confirm that the outlet sample follows sufficient mixing distance. Account for travel time before comparing predicted and measured concentrations so different water parcels are not subtracted as if simultaneous.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"維持總流量五立方公尺每秒，把較高濃度來源減至一立方公尺每秒，重算混合濃度並畫比例曲線，註明這只是保守溶質的教材。","textEn":"Keep total flow at five cubic metres per second, reduce the higher-concentration source to one and recalculate the blend. Plot concentration against source fraction and label the conservative-solute assumption explicitly.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「原水保守溶質混合」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Conservative raw water mixing\"?","options":["以相同時段的兩股來源流量及濃度求輸入質量率，核對混合後取樣位置已有足夠混合距離。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只知道水位增量就能判斷剩餘蓄洪空間"],"optionsEn":["Use simultaneous source flows and concentrations to calculate input mass rate and confirm that the outlet sample follows sufficient mixing distance.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Knowing only level increment establishes remaining flood-storage capacity"],"answer":0,"explanation":"以相同時段的兩股來源流量及濃度求輸入質量率，核對混合後取樣位置已有足夠混合距離。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Use simultaneous source flows and concentrations to calculate input mass rate and confirm that the outlet sample follows sufficient mixing distance. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b216-v15-40","title":"原水保守溶質混合：失效診斷","titleEn":"Conservative raw water mixing: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"prerequisiteIds":["b216-v15-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「原水保守溶質混合」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Conservative raw water mixing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"拿濁度直接做保守濃度混合可能因顆粒絮凝而失準；若取樣位置尚未混勻，單點量值會偏向某股來源，即使整體質量守恆正確仍看似不符合公式。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Applying conservative mixing to turbidity can fail because particles flocculate. Before complete mixing, a single sample may favor one source, appearing to violate the equation even when the overall mass balance is correct. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：質量守恆以溶質通量為基礎，濃度本身不能直接相加；每股流量權重的總和必須等於一，混合濃度應介於兩來源之間。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Flow weights must sum to unity, and a conservative two-source blend should lie between the source concentrations when both flows are positive.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「兩股流量不同時仍可把濃度直接取算術平均」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Two concentrations can be averaged arithmetically even when source flows differ\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b216-v15-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"拿濁度直接做保守濃度混合可能因顆粒絮凝而失準；若取樣位置尚未混勻，單點量值會偏向某股來源，即使整體質量守恆正確仍看似不符合公式。","textEn":"Applying conservative mixing to turbidity can fail because particles flocculate. Before complete mixing, a single sample may favor one source, appearing to violate the equation even when the overall mass balance is correct.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]},{"id":"b216-v15-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「原水保守溶質混合」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Conservative raw water mixing\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","拿濁度直接做保守濃度混合可能因顆粒絮凝而失準；若取樣位置尚未混勻，單點量值會偏向某股來源，即使整體質量守恆正確仍看似不符合公式。","名目停留時間就是每滴水完全相同的水齡"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Applying conservative mixing to turbidity can fail because particles flocculate.","Nominal residence time is the identical age of every water parcel"],"answer":1,"explanation":"拿濁度直接做保守濃度混合可能因顆粒絮凝而失準；若取樣位置尚未混勻，單點量值會偏向某股來源，即使整體質量守恆正確仍看似不符合公式。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Applying conservative mixing to turbidity can fail because particles flocculate. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v15s-feitsui-owner","v15s-feitsui-history","v15s-usace-arch","b-src-water"],"curriculumVersion":15,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
